{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"catalogs/runtime/scenes/89578d7a11298691543d.json":{"assets":{"ep3/quest_story_13224020":{"skip":{"source_cn":"你从侍卫长罗德里戈那里得知白山的秩序正处于混乱中，因为宫廷人手不足导致工作堆积如山，你们决定有空就来协助他。","text_i18n":{"cn":"你从侍卫长罗德里戈那里得知白山的秩序正处于混乱中，因为宫廷人手不足导致工作堆积如山，你们决定有空就来协助他。","en":"You learn from Captain Rodrigo that Whiteridge has descended into chaos. There simply aren't enough court guards, leaving piles of unfinished work. You decide to help him whenever you have time.","jp":"護衛隊長のロドリゴから、宮廷の人手不足の影響もありホワイトマウンテンの秩序が乱れていることを聞かされた。そこであなたたちは、時間がある時に彼を手伝うことにした。","kr":"화이트마운틴이 혼란에 빠져있다는 근위대장 로드리고의 말을 들었다. 궁정의 일손이 부족해 해결할 일이 산더미처럼 쌓여 있다. 시간이 될 때마다 로드리고를 돕기로 했다."},"source":"Plot.SkipText","plot_ids":["13224020"],"localization_status":"exact_hash","record_indices":["24232"]}}}},"locales/cn/ep3/quest_story/13224010.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13224010","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13224010","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:0:1322401001:0":{"text":"我看到侍卫长罗德里戈了……他看上去可真憔悴。","source_cn":"我看到侍卫长罗德里戈了……他看上去可真憔悴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F55A0D50BEAF9AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1322401002:0":{"text":"我们过去看望下他吧，主人！","source_cn":"我们过去看望下他吧，主人！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x91239542265ED3B4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"我们过去看望下他吧，主人！","female":"我们过去看望下他吧，主人！","variant_male_record_index":"151182","variant_female_record_index":"151183","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"漫漫","source":"漫漫","status":"source"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"满满","source":"满满","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/cn/ep3